{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-36532","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59589","text":"TRAAVIIS — Episode Evidence "},{"id":"spn-59590","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reopen"},{"id":"spn-59591","text":" Closure (memo for GPT-5.6)"}]},{"id":"blk-36533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59592","text":"Date: 2026-07-24. Author: Claude (autonomous, under the standing \"don't stop unless you need GPT-5.6\" instruction). This memo + the accompanying archive cover the "},{"id":"spn-59593","marks":["bold"],"text":"Episode Evidence Reopen Closure"},{"id":"spn-59594","text":" you ruled after empirically verifying the prior Episode Evidence Closure packet and finding real defects. It is additive on top of "},{"id":"spn-59595","marks":["code"],"text":"TRAAVIIS_EPISODE_EVIDENCE_MEMO.md"},{"id":"spn-59596","text":" (which stays valid as the prior slice)."}]},{"id":"blk-36534","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59597","text":"The reopen ruling's headline: "},{"id":"spn-59598","marks":["bold"],"text":"stored-only self-consistency is insufficient."},{"id":"spn-59599","text":" A saved receipt recomputing to its own "},{"id":"spn-59600","marks":["code"],"text":"episode-…"},{"id":"spn-59601","text":" proves nothing about whether the "},{"id":"spn-59602","marks":["italic"],"text":"evidence beside it"},{"id":"spn-59603","text":" actually produces that receipt. So verification now "},{"id":"spn-59604","marks":["bold"],"text":"derives a fresh receipt from the saved evidence"},{"id":"spn-59605","text":" and requires it to be byte-identical to the stored one."}]},{"id":"blk-36535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59606","marks":["bold"],"text":"Full battery green on this machine (real TRVM engine reachable):"},{"id":"spn-59607","text":" "},{"id":"spn-59608","marks":["code"],"text":"250 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed"},{"id":"spn-59609","text":" across 17 modules ("},{"id":"spn-59610","marks":["code"],"text":"test_episode_evidence.py"},{"id":"spn-59611","text":" went 18 → 40; all other modules unchanged and still green)."}]},{"id":"blk-36536","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59612","text":"1. The 12 ruled steps — where each landed"}]},{"id":"blk-36537","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59613","text":"Step 1 — shared "},{"id":"spn-59614","marks":["code"],"text":"ReceiptBuilderV1"}]},{"id":"blk-36538","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59615","text":"Receipt construction was pulled out of "},{"id":"spn-59616","marks":["code"],"text":"evalone.evaluate()"},{"id":"spn-59617","text":" into two functions in "},{"id":"spn-59618","marks":["code"],"text":"traaviis/evalone.py"},{"id":"spn-59619","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-36539","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36541","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59620","marks":["code"],"text":"_assemble_receipt(...)"},{"id":"spn-59621","text":" — assembles the 14-key receipt + sets "},{"id":"spn-59622","marks":["code"],"text":"episode_id"},{"id":"spn-59623","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-36540","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-36543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59624","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1(...)"},{"id":"spn-59625","text":" (exported) — computes "},{"id":"spn-59626","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-59627","text":", builds "},{"id":"spn-59628","marks":["code"],"text":"verification_evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-36542","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-36544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59629","text":"over the scored signals, derives "},{"id":"spn-59630","marks":["code"],"text":"outputs"},{"id":"spn-59631","text":", and calls "},{"id":"spn-59632","marks":["code"],"text":"_assemble_receipt"},{"id":"spn-59633","text":". Returns "},{"id":"spn-59634","marks":["code"],"text":"(receipt, verifier_evidence)"},{"id":"spn-59635","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36545","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59636","text":"Both the live "},{"id":"spn-59637","marks":["code"],"text":"evaluate()"},{"id":"spn-59638","text":" "},{"id":"spn-59639","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-59640","text":" "},{"id":"spn-59641","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle()"},{"id":"spn-59642","text":" now go through "},{"id":"spn-59643","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-59644","text":", so live and replay cannot structurally drift."}]},{"id":"blk-36546","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59645","text":"Step 2 — derive a fresh receipt on replay, require equality"}]},{"id":"blk-36547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59646","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-59647","text":" rebuilds the receipt via "},{"id":"spn-59648","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-59649","text":" from the saved evidence and asserts "},{"id":"spn-59650","marks":["code"],"text":"canonicalize_episode(derived) == canonicalize_episode(stored)"},{"id":"spn-59651","text":" "},{"id":"spn-59652","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-59653","text":" "},{"id":"spn-59654","marks":["code"],"text":"episode_id(derived) == stored == identity.episode_id(receipt) == manifest.episode_id"},{"id":"spn-59655","text":". This single comparison subsumes reward + outputs + execution facts. New checks: "},{"id":"spn-59656","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"receipt\"]"},{"id":"spn-59657","text":" and the tightened "},{"id":"spn-59658","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"episode_id\"]"},{"id":"spn-59659","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59660","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59661","marks":["code"],"text":"test_derived_receipt_equals_stored_receipt"},{"id":"spn-59662","text":" (positive) and "},{"id":"spn-59663","marks":["code"],"text":"test_stored_only_self_consistency_is_insufficient"},{"id":"spn-59664","text":" (a receipt re-sealed to be internally self-consistent after a lie still fails, because the evidence-derived receipt disagrees)."}]},{"id":"blk-36549","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59665","text":"Step 3 — verify every declared self-id + rerun cross-binding"}]},{"id":"blk-36550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59666","marks":["code"],"text":"_declared_ok"},{"id":"spn-59667","text":" wraps "},{"id":"spn-59668","marks":["code"],"text":"admission.verify_declared_id"},{"id":"spn-59669","text":" for snapshot / reward / task / trace (closure) and finding (artifacts). Each record's declared id must be internally consistent "},{"id":"spn-59670","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-59671","text":" equal the id the receipt references (both directions). "},{"id":"spn-59672","marks":["code"],"text":"admission.cross_bind_task(task, reward_id, snapshot_id)"},{"id":"spn-59673","text":" is rerun."}]},{"id":"blk-36551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59674","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59675","marks":["code"],"text":"test_false_declared_{snapshot,task,reward,trace,finding}_id_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59676","text":", "},{"id":"spn-59677","marks":["code"],"text":"test_task_reward_cross_binding_mismatch_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59678","text":", "},{"id":"spn-59679","marks":["code"],"text":"test_task_snapshot_cross_binding_mismatch_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59680","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36552","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59681","text":"Step 4 — exact verifier-evidence closure"}]},{"id":"blk-36553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59682","text":"Requires "},{"id":"spn-59683","marks":["code"],"text":"set(manifest verifier keys) == set(receipt.verification_evidence keys) == set(scored signals)"},{"id":"spn-59684","text":". Missing / extra / swapped signal evidence fails in "},{"id":"spn-59685","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"artifacts\"]"},{"id":"spn-59686","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59687","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59688","marks":["code"],"text":"test_missing_verifier_evidence_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59689","text":", "},{"id":"spn-59690","marks":["code"],"text":"test_missing_verifier_manifest_entry_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59691","text":", "},{"id":"spn-59692","marks":["code"],"text":"test_extra_verifier_evidence_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59693","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36555","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59694","text":"Step 5 — exact contract "},{"id":"spn-59695","marks":["bold"],"text":"and"},{"id":"spn-59696","text":" implementation version match → "},{"id":"spn-59697","marks":["code"],"text":"unavailable"}]},{"id":"blk-36556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59698","marks":["code"],"text":"fresh_versions"},{"id":"spn-59699","text":" is built from the reward's contracts + the wired verifiers' implementations, driven by what the receipt sealed: a scored signal whose sealed implementation is "},{"id":"spn-59700","marks":["code"],"text":"null"},{"id":"spn-59701","text":" was UNWIRED at eval time and stays unwired (→ "},{"id":"spn-59702","marks":["code"],"text":"not_applicable"},{"id":"spn-59703","text":", no spurious mismatch); a non-null sealed implementation must be reproduced by an available verifier "},{"id":"spn-59704","marks":["bold"],"text":"of the same version"},{"id":"spn-59705","text":", else "},{"id":"spn-59706","marks":["code"],"text":"checks[\"verifier_versions\"].ok = False"},{"id":"spn-59707","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-59708","marks":["bold"],"text":"outcome `unavailable` (exit 2)"},{"id":"spn-59709","text":", never an evidence failure."}]},{"id":"blk-36557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59710","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59711","marks":["code"],"text":"test_verifier_implementation_drift_is_unavailable"},{"id":"spn-59712","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36558","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59713","text":"Step 6 — persist + replay policy-violation evidence (REVERSES the prior ruling)"}]},{"id":"blk-36559","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59714","marks":["code"],"text":"_populate"},{"id":"spn-59715","text":" writes "},{"id":"spn-59716","marks":["code"],"text":"evidence/process/policy-violations.json"},{"id":"spn-59717","text":". Replay loads it, re-attests it against the trace's "},{"id":"spn-59718","marks":["code"],"text":"policy_violations_digest"},{"id":"spn-59719","text":", and sets "},{"id":"spn-59720","marks":["code"],"text":"tampered = bool(violations)"},{"id":"spn-59721","text":" — feeding "},{"id":"spn-59722","marks":["code"],"text":"build_receipt_v1"},{"id":"spn-59723","text":" so the derived receipt reproduces the tamper verdict. (This reverses the prior \"score the un-tampered path\" decision you rejected.)"}]},{"id":"blk-36560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59724","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59725","marks":["code"],"text":"test_authentic_tampered_episode_reverifies_invalid"},{"id":"spn-59726","text":" (a real policy violation → the bundle CLOSES, sealed + derived receipts both read "},{"id":"spn-59727","marks":["code"],"text":"invalid"},{"id":"spn-59728","text":"), "},{"id":"spn-59729","marks":["code"],"text":"test_policy_violation_bytes_match_trace_digest"},{"id":"spn-59730","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36561","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59731","text":"Step 7 — preserve snapshot file modes on materialization"}]},{"id":"blk-36562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59732","text":"New "},{"id":"spn-59733","marks":["code"],"text":"admission.materialize_subject(snapshot, content, root)"},{"id":"spn-59734","text":" restores each path's sealed "},{"id":"spn-59735","marks":["code"],"text":"file_modes"},{"id":"spn-59736","text":" (default "},{"id":"spn-59737","marks":["code"],"text":"0644"},{"id":"spn-59738","text":"), so a "},{"id":"spn-59739","marks":["code"],"text":"0755"},{"id":"spn-59740","text":" executable survives persistence and re-admits. "},{"id":"spn-59741","marks":["code"],"text":"_populate"},{"id":"spn-59742","text":" uses it instead of the runner's umask-dropping writer."}]},{"id":"blk-36563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59743","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59744","marks":["code"],"text":"test_0755_subject_mode_survives_persistence"},{"id":"spn-59745","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36564","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59746","text":"Step 8 — strictly decode candidate patches"}]},{"id":"blk-36565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59747","marks":["code"],"text":"runner.py"},{"id":"spn-59748","text":" reads the patch as bytes and decodes strict UTF-8 (invalid → no patch). "},{"id":"spn-59749","marks":["code"],"text":"verify_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-59750","text":" decodes the saved "},{"id":"spn-59751","marks":["code"],"text":"candidate.patch"},{"id":"spn-59752","text":" strict UTF-8 (invalid → artifact failure)."}]},{"id":"blk-36566","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59753","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59754","marks":["code"],"text":"test_invalid_utf8_patch_rejected"},{"id":"spn-59755","text":", "},{"id":"spn-59756","marks":["code"],"text":"test_runner_rejects_invalid_utf8_patch"},{"id":"spn-59757","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36567","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-59758","text":"Step 9 — verify staging bundle before atomic publication"}]},{"id":"blk-36568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59759","marks":["code"],"text":"write_episode_bundle"},{"id":"spn-59760","text":" populates a temp sibling → "},{"id":"spn-59761","marks":["bold"],"text":"fully verifies the staged tree with the same `verify_episode_bundle` a reader runs"},{"id":"spn-59762","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-59763","marks":["code"],"text":"_fsync_tree"},{"id":"spn-59764","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-59765","marks":["code"],"text":"os.rename"},{"id":"spn-59766","text":". A staged bundle that does not close ("},{"id":"spn-59767","marks":["code"],"text":"outcome != closed"},{"id":"spn-59768","text":") raises and leaves NO final directory."}]},{"id":"blk-36569","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-59769","text":"Battery: "},{"id":"spn-59770","marks":["code"],"text":"test_bad_staging_bundle_is_never_published"},{"id":"spn-59771","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-36570"